      instruction: "88.1 Using information from the table in A, explain the basic meanings of these words. — 88.2 Look at the following word parts. Use a dictionary to find two new words beginning with these and write them in your vocabulary notebook. Choose only words that use the meanings studied in this unit. Postman, for example, clearly has not been formed using the prefix post- meaning ‘after’. — 88.3 Rewrite these sentences, replacing the underlined words with a word that includes the word part given. Use a dictionary if necessary. — 88.4 Rewrite these sentences, replacing the underlined word with an explanatory phrase. — 88.5 What words have been combined to make these blends? What do you think they mean?",
